<main class="nitroship-rails">
  <h1>Hello Rails from Nitroship</h1>
  <p>This page is rendered by Rails on Nitroship Compute.</p>
  <p>Server time: <time datetime="<%= @server_time %>"><%= @server_time %></time></p>
  <p>Reload to render a new timestamp. The stylesheet is precompiled into <code>public/assets</code> and published to the CDN.</p>
  <p><%= link_to "Read the JSON API", "/api/hello" %></p>
  <p>No database, background worker, or persistent local storage is required.</p>
</main>
